## Why This Is Asked

This question assesses practical skills in cross-platform UI, accessibility, and basic animation with React Native—core for production onboarding flows on constrained devices.

## Key Concepts

- Accessibility in React Native (accessibilityLabel, accessibilityHint, accessible)
- Basic animation patterns (Animated or Reanimated) and sequencing
- State flow for multi-screen experiences
